message: >-
  If you use Kendr Optimizer in research or evaluation, please cite the software
  and identify the exact version or commit you evaluated.
title: Kendr Optimizer
type: software
authors:
  - name: Kendr Optimizer contributors
abstract: >-
  A model-neutral engine for reducing the token surface of LLM requests and
  future conversation context while returning verification results and an
  explicit optimization receipt.
